OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain throughout. Rain
OL,7,Fwill mostly be light and patchy but
OL,8,Fsome heavier bursts are possible,
OL,9,Fespecially near northern and eastern
OL,10,Fcoasts where winds will also be
OL,11,Ffresher.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fcontinuing overnight. Rain mostly
OL,15,Flight in the evening with some drier
OL,16,Fspells before heavier downpours spread
OL,17,Fnorthwards overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
