OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA cloudy morning with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some heavy.
OL,7,FBecoming drier through the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith some brighter spells possibly
OL,9,Fdeveloping from the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt will
OL,12,Fbe dry and cold on Friday and Saturday
OL,13,Fwith long sunny spells and overnight
OL,14,Ffrost. Turning cloudier on Sunday with
OL,15,Fwinds strengthening and rain spreading
OL,16,Fnorthwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
